{
  "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Children’s stuff table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,22,50]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 You find a creepy doll with a blood spattered dress. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,50,109]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may take it if you wish (counts as 1 carried object).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,109,163]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 You find a box of plastic construction bricks.  You may take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,163,226]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "them if you wish (they count as 1 carried object).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,226,277]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,277,279]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find a sketchbook signed by a child aged 9. It contains\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,279,339]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disturbingly realistic paintings of parents wearing goat\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,339,396]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "horns on their heads. You realize that the brown color\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,396,451]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "used in the art is dried blood. Save vs. L2 Fear or lose 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,451,510]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity. Gain 1 Clue.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,510,531]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,531,533]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find a length of cord with several knots. If you have an\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,533,594]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "occult guide, play event #36. You may keep the cord and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,594,650]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "go to event #36 as soon as you find an occult guide. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,650,707]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cord’s weight is negligible.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,707,736]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,736,738]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find a rubber mask. It looks like a clown’s face. Weight\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,738,799]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is negligible. You may wear it if you want (add the keyword\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,799,859]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "CLOWNFACE to your play sheet), but your Charisma rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,859,914]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will be at -1 if you do.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,914,939]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,939,941]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find a pumpkin carved into a jack o’ lantern. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,941,998]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have a candle, you may light it and put it inside. Play event\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,998,1060]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#40 if you do so. The pumpkin counts as 1 carried object.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,1060,1118]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "All of these findings are unique. If you roll a result that you already\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,1118,1190]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolled before, reroll until you select something different. If you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,1190,1262]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "already found or discarded all the above items and are required to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,1262,1329]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll on this table, roll on the Useful Stuff or on the Random Object\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,1329,1398]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-children-s-stuff-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table (your choice) instead.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[55,1398,1426]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    55
  ]
}
